<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Qantas no comment on Air NZ sale talk.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Qantas no comment on Air NZ sale talk.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qantas Airways Ltd said on Tuesday it had no comment on market talk that it was about to sell its 19.4 percent stake in Air New Zealand Ltd.</p>
<p>A Qantas spokesman said the company would make no comment on market rumours. Qantas holds about 100 million 'B' shares in the New Zealand carrier. Qantas shares closed two cents higher at A$2.47 on turnover of 4.3 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
